  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>안녕하세요!</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>6단원 수업 준비를 하다가 간단하게 크롬북이나 핸드폰으로 할 수 있을 것 같아서</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>여기에 올려봅니다~</b></span></p><p><a href=\"https://filest.edunet.net/360vr/webvr/m232001084/m232001084.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://filest.edunet.net/360vr/webvr/m232001084/m232001084.html</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"실감형콘텐츠 웹으로 보기 | 롤러코스터 설계하기\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"filest.edunet.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://filest.edunet.net/360vr/webvr/m232001084/m232001084.html\" data-og-url=\"https://filest.edunet.net/360vr/webvr/m232001084/m232001084.html\" data-og-image=\"\"><a href=\"https://filest.edunet.net/360vr/webvr/m232001084/m232001084.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://filest.edunet.net/360vr/webvr/m232001084/m232001084.html\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">실감형콘텐츠 웹으로 보기 | 롤러코스터 설계하기</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">filest.edunet.net</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">정말정말 간단한 콘텐츠이지만, 그래도 교과서에 많이 나오는</span></b></p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">롤러코스터의 예를 간접적으로나마 설계하며</span></b></p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">개념을 다시 확인할 수 있을 것 같아요!</span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">중간중간 막대 그래프로 위치 에너지 &amp; 운동 에너지의 변화도 알려줍니다...ㅎㅎ</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dadbdc5d43e501cd3830a56c7a86ead34849fd4d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dadbdc5d43e501cd3830a56c7a86ead34849fd4d\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"603\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff4a6ef138eb3d7e1164243e2bb8f317fe4c51da\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff4a6ef138eb3d7e1164243e2bb8f317fe4c51da\" data-origin-width=\"955\" data-origin-height=\"595\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/33d3838e5fb36d23fc03b4f6d83dd57bbab6eb38\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/33d3838e5fb36d23fc03b4f6d83dd57bbab6eb38\" data-origin-width=\"953\" data-origin-height=\"591\"><div class=\"figcaption\">이래뵈도 VR입니다(?)</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/046ed24dbf29f30e7eba7309da6541bcbcfa8d77\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/046ed24dbf29f30e7eba7309da6541bcbcfa8d77\" data-origin-width=\"955\" data-origin-height=\"590\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
